{"id":"n60616-3-7","stage":4,"title":"불량 · 不良","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60616-3-7-1","ko":"새로 전화기를 샀는데 자주 통화가 끊겨.","zh":"我刚买了新手机，但通话经常断线。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"전화기를","meaning":"电话机","explanation":"전화기：电话机；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전화기","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70846","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화기를","audio":"/audio/0fa5e90bf0e57d44b5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"샀는데","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀는데","audio":"/audio/0c23eff2aea0d31cc0d1.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"통화가","meaning":"通话","explanation":"통화：通话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"통화","audio":"/audio/1566f907a6cafa98c014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82044","senseId":"1","lemma":"통화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통화가","audio":"/audio/1028da21c2cb504473da.mp3"}},{"text":"끊겨.","meaning":"挂断，切断","explanation":"끊기다：挂断，切断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"끊기다","audio":"/audio/1c17513212c92636598a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14657","senseId":"10","lemma":"